    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cycle has destroyed most people. But can you be the one to break it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can\u2019t You Run?</strong> is a psychological horror game where escape is just an illusion. Trapped in an ever-shrinking, haunted space, you must collect essential items to survive. But no matter how many times you try, true escape remains just out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>An Unrelenting Loop:</strong> Every attempt pushes you deeper into an endless cycle of fear and desperation.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Dark and Oppressive Atmosphere:</strong> Light is your only ally, but even it won\u2019t save you.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Strategic Survival:</strong> Gather weapons and supplies through multiple levels, preparing for the ultimate test.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Deadly Final Challenge:</strong> Reach the final stage, where nightmarish creatures await. Are you truly ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding, no second chances. <strong>You can run, but not forward.</strong></p>",
